 and mischievous succubus which can cling to you with her claws from the side where you don't expect it. Shiina knows a lot about tea, and she can be seen with a cup of this drink pretty often. As a rich woman, Shiina, just like her brother, prefers to move to the destination by helicopter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11782"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db3b4ef29cb592630f92f54e112c3551e1bc59f61614a7655bd1e3c548a44062.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93ab87a70f0b93ade5b4d32d484ef9cc18bc33a227d8025003a22b71390449ca.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野神 奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s124","name":"本井 えみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3135","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11783","characterName":"埴御 一二三","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11783"},"originalCharacterName":"埴御 一二三","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hifumi is a genius, but acts like an idiot. He always comes up with the stupid ideas and dresses up in a silly costumes. In addition, this pervert dreams of being surrounded by girls which will call him Onii-chan. Considering that the Kimikage Academy was built at the expense of Hanimi parents, he can get away with anything."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11783"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfff22affd940e83c3e1c1fb2f4027c97a86487d9e1d379f30fdcec23e3827a3.webp","fallba